pular\">Most Used</span><div class=\"card-main\"><div class=\"strip-preview\"><img src=\"/assets/strips/lensbooth-classic-preview.webp?v=035b6f03\" alt=\"ConstBooth Classic\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"1348\"></div><span>ConstBooth Classic</span></div></div><div class=\"strip-card\" data-style=\"denim\"><span class=\"strip-badge badge-fav\">Users Fav</span><div class=\"card-main\"><div class=\"strip-preview\"><img src=\"/assets/strips/Denim-Dreams-opt.webp?v=c8bcc36f\" alt=\"Denim Dreams\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"1348\"></div><span>Denim Dreams</span></div></div><div class=\"strip-card\" data-style=\"retro\"><span class=\"strip-badge badge-popular\">Most Used</span><div class=\"card-main\"><div class=\"strip-preview\"><img src=\"/assets/strips/Retro-Film-opt.webp?v=4a092c01\" alt=\"Retro Film\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"1348\"></div><span>Retro Film</span></div></div><div class=\"strip-card\" data-style=\"love\"><span class=\"strip-badge badge-fav\">Users Fav</span><div class=\"card-main\"><div class=\"strip-preview\"><img src=\"/assets/strips/Love-Frames-opt.webp?v=bb8ba377\" alt=\"Heartline\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"1348\"></div><span>Heartline</span></div></div><div class=\"strip-card\" data-style=\"cherry\"><span class=\"strip-badge badge-fav\">Users Fav</span><div class=\"card-main\"><div class=\"strip-preview\"><img src=\"/assets/strips/Cherry-Crush-opt.webp?v=42f15c52\" alt=\"Cherry Crush\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"1348\"></div><span>Cherry Crush</span></div></div><div class=\"strip-card\" data-style=\"kitty\"><span class=\"strip-badge badge-popular\">Most Used</span><div class=\"card-main\"><div class=\"strip-preview\"><img src=\"/assets/strips/Kittyframes-opt.webp?v=ccc1c212\" alt=\"Cat Club\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"1348\"></div><span>Cat Club</span></div></div></div><button class=\"nav-arrow right\" id=\"next-btn\" aria-label=\"Next photo strip style\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 6L8.59 7.41 13.17 12l-4.58 4.59L10 18l6-6z\"/></svg></button></div></section><section id=\"instant-cards-panel\" class=\"mode-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-cards\"><div class=\"ic-layout-list\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Card layouts\"><div class=\"ic-layout-row\" data-layout=\"single\" role=\"listitem\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Portrait photo\"><div class=\"ic-row-preview\"><div class=\"ic-preview-slot ic-preview-slot--tall\"></div></div><div class=\"ic-row-info\"><div class=\"ic-row-title\">Portrait</div><div class=\"ic-row-desc\">One large photo · Portrait style</div></div><div class=\"ic-row-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"/><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"/></svg></div></div><div class=\"ic-layout-row\" data-layout=\"double\" role=\"listitem\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Stack photo\"><div class=\"ic-row-preview\"><div class=\"ic-preview-slot\"></div><div class=\"ic-preview-slot\"></div></div><div class=\"ic-row-info\"><div class=\"ic-row-title\">Stack</div><div class=\"ic-row-desc\">Two stacked photos · Couples &amp; friends</div></div><div class=\"ic-row-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"/><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"/></svg></div></div><div class=\"ic-layout-row\" data-layout=\"triple\" role=\"listitem\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Storyboard photo\"><div class=\"ic-row-preview\"><div class=\"ic-preview-slot\"></div><div class=\"ic-preview-slot\"></div><div class=\"ic-preview-slot\"></div></div><div class=\"ic-row-info\"><div class=\"ic-row-title\">Storyboard</div><div class=\"ic-row-desc\">Three photos in a card · Groups</div></div><div class=\"ic-row-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"/><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"/></svg></div></div><div class=\"ic-layout-row\" data-layout=\"grid\" role=\"listitem\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Collage photo\"><div class=\"ic-row-preview ic-row-preview--grid\"><div class=\"ic-preview-slot\"></div><div class=\"ic-preview-slot\"></div><div class=\"ic-preview-slot\"></div><div class=\"ic-preview-slot\"></div></div><div class=\"ic-row-info\"><div class=\"ic-row-title\">Collage</div><div class=\"ic-row-desc\">Four photos in 2×2 · Memories</div></div><div class=\"ic-row-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"/><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"/></svg></div></div></div></section><aside class=\"lb-rail lb-rail--top lb-rail--l\" data-rail=\"top\" aria-label=\"Advertisement\"><div class=\"lb-rail-ad\"></div></aside><aside class=\"lb-rail lb-rail--top lb-rail--r\" data-rail=\"top\" aria-label=\"Advertisement\"><div class=\"lb-rail-ad\"></div></aside></div>\n\n<section class=\"pex\" aria-labelledby=\"pex-title\"><aside class=\"lb-rail lb-rail--content lb-rail--follow lb-rail--l\" data-rail=\"content\" aria-label=\"Advertisement\"><div class=\"lb-rail-ad\"></div></aside><aside class=\"lb-rail lb-rail--content lb-rail--follow lb-rail--r\" data-rail=\"content\" aria-label=\"Advertisement\"><div class=\"lb-rail-ad\"></div></aside><div class=\"pex-inner\">\n\n\n<div class=\"pex-lead\"><h2 id=\"pex-title\">Free photo strip maker online - vintage filters &amp; custom frames</h2><p>Pick a style, choose your layout, and start snapping in a free online photo booth. Create classic 4-frame vertical strips, Korean Life4Cuts-style designs, and Polaroid-style instant frames. 15+ vintage and retro designs, solo or live with a friend. No app downloads, no account, and completely free - just open your browser.</p></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"pex-block\"><h2>Two ways to snap photo booth strips online</h2><div class=\"pex-grid\">\n<div class=\"pex-card\"><div class=\"pex-card-icon\" style=\"background:#ffe100\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"2\" width=\"14\" height=\"20\" rx=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"7\"></line><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"11\"></line><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"15\"></line></svg></div><h3>Photo Strips</h3><p><strong>The classic vertical strip &amp; Korean 4-cuts.</strong> Takes multiple photos in a row with a short countdown before each shot. Choose from retro film, pixel art, vintage postage, denim, and cute seasonal frames with vintage photo booth filters - 100% free with no watermark.</p><p>Great for quick solo selfies, authentic Life4Cuts-style strips, or a live Shared Booth date with friends or long-distance partners.</p></div>\n<div class=\"pex-card\"><div class=\"pex-card-icon\" style=\"background:#ff6de4\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\"></rect><rect x=\"6\" y=\"6\" width=\"12\" height=\"9\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"19\" x2=\"9\" y2=\"19\"></line><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"19\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"19\"></line><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"19\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"19\"></line></svg></div><h3>Polaroid-Style Instant Frames</h3><p><strong>Single framed photos &amp; collages.</strong> Pick a layout: a classic white-border Polaroid-style single portrait, a 2-photo stack, a 3-photo story, or a 4-photo grid collage.</p><p>Perfect when you want an authentic polaroid or instant card keepsake for your Instagram story, lock screen, or physical scrapbook.</p></div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"pex-block\"><h2>How this photo strip maker works</h2><ul class=\"pex-list\">\n<li><strong>Pick your style.</strong> Browse 15+ vintage and retro strip themes and instant frame layouts above. You can change your mind whenever you want.</li>\n<li><strong>Open the booth.</strong> Head to the <a href=\"/booth\">free photo booth</a> to shoot by yourself in Solo Booth or send an invite link to someone for a live Shared Booth.</li>\n<li><strong>Pose for the camera.</strong> A 3-second countdown gives you time to pose. If you're in a Shared Booth, both cameras snap at the exact same second.</li>\n<li><strong>Download your strip.</strong> Your photos are put together instantly right inside your browser. Download the high-quality, watermark-free image file straight to your phone or computer.</li>\n</ul></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"pex-block\"><h2>What you can do with your photos</h2><p>Once you download your strip, it's just a normal high-quality photo file. You can post it on Instagram, send it in chat, make it your lock screen, or print it out.</p><p>If you want to print your strips on photo paper, check out our guides on  and . We also have a quick guide on .</p><p>If you love how your strip turned out, you can submit it to the Community Spotlight on our homepage to get featured.</p></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"pex-block\"><h2>Privacy and how your photos are handled</h2><ul class=\"pex-list\">\n<li><strong>Your photos stay on your device.</strong> When using a regular browser, your pictures are captured and assembled on your phone or laptop. Nothing is saved to our servers.</li>\n<li><strong>Opening from Instagram or Facebook?</strong> In-app browsers can't save files directly from memory, so strips are temporarily held under a random code for 3 minutes just so you can download them, then automatically deleted. Read our full  for details.</li>\n<li><strong>Download or save to your account.</strong> You can download your strip directly to your device without an account, or sign in with Google to save strips to your account and view them across devices.</li>\n<li><strong>Tips for better photos.</strong> ConstBooth uses your device's camera. Good lighting makes a huge difference - check out our  and .</li>\n</ul></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"pex-block\"><h2>Photo strip questions</h2><h3>What size is a ConstBooth photo strip?</h3><p>A ConstBooth strip follows the classic vertical photo booth proportions, so it prints cleanly at the traditional 2 x 6 inch strip size and sits neatly on an A6 or A4 sheet when you print several at once. Sheet dimensions follow <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_216\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ISO 216</a>, and printing sharply means exporting at <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dots_per_inch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">300 DPI</a> or better.</p><h3>Can I change the frame after I have taken my photos?</h3><p>Yes. Pick any style before you start, and you can restyle the same set of photos afterwards without shooting again.</p><h3>What is the difference between a photo strip and an instant frame?</h3><p>A photo strip takes several photos in a row with a countdown before each shot and stacks them vertically. An instant frame captures a single framed photo, or a small layout such as a two-photo stack, a three-photo storyboard or a 2x2 collage.</p><h3>Do I need an account to use a strip style?</h3><p>No. Every style is free and available immediately. There is no sign-up, no subscription and nothing to pay for.</p><h3>Can I use a strip style in Shared Booth with a friend?</h3><p>Yes. Every photo strip style works in both Solo Booth and Shared Booth, so you and a friend in another location end up on the same strip.</p><h3>Can I make Life4Cuts or Korean-style photo strips?</h3><p>Yes. ConstBooth lets you create authentic Korean 4-cut (Life4Cuts) photo strips directly in your browser. Choose our 4-frame vertical layout, pick cute pastel or vintage border styles, and download crisp 300 DPI strips ready for your phone case or printing.</p><h3>Can I make Polaroid-style photos with this strip maker?</h3><p>Yes. Switch to the Instant Frames tab to produce Polaroid-style prints with classic white borders, retro color filters, and custom timestamps in single-portrait, 2-photo stack, 3-photo story, or 2x2 collage layouts.</p><p>More detail in our guides to  and .</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"pex-block\"><h2>Ready to snap?</h2><p>Choose a style above and open the <a href=\"/booth\">booth</a> to get started. Have questions or need help? .</p>\n<div class=\"pex-more\"><a href=\"/booth\">Open Booth</a></div></div>\n\n\n</div></section></main><script src=\"/shared/header.min.js?v=1792303740000\" defer></script><script src=\"/js/in-app-detector.min.js?v=1792303740000\" defer=\"defer\"></script><script src=\"/js/strips.min.js?v=1792303740000\" defer=\"defer\"></script><script src=\"/js/instant-cards.min.js?v=1792303740000\" defer=\"defer\"></script><script>(function(){function wireBackLink(){try{var backBtns=document.querySelectorAll(\"#nav-back-btn, #mobile-back-btn\");Array.prototype.forEach.call(backBtns,function(btn){btn.setAttribute(\"href\",\"/booth\");btn.addEventListener(\"click\",function(){try{localStorage.removeItem(\"boothType\");localStorage.removeItem(\"targetUrl\");localStorage.removeItem(\"lb_booth_id\");sessionStorage.removeItem(\"lb_booth_id\");sessionStorage.removeItem(\"lb_strip_locked\");sessionStorage.removeItem(\"lb_solo_skip_booth\");}catch(e){}});});}catch(e){}}\"loading\"===document.readyState?document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\",wireBackLink):wireBackLink();})();</script><footer><nav class=\"lb-minimal-legal\" aria-label=\"Legal & Information\"><div class=\"lb-minimal-legal-inner\"><div class=\"lb-mi